	(property "Description" "A pogo module's place on the keyboard board (joystick/Alpsalpine-pogo, trackball/PMW3610-pogo and trackball/PMW3610-side-pogo, by joystick/joystick-mount-pogo), for a module with six pogo pins in a 1 x 6 column at 2.54 mm onto the contact pads next to it (Pogo_Target_1x6_P2.54mm, at x -11, by the thumb): the module in its printed cartridge, whose base stands on this board with a spigot in each hole it uses. Five 2.2 mm holes: four at (+-12.35, +-10.85), for the joystick and the trackball read from above, turned half a turn so their pins come to x -11; and (24.5, 0), which the side-read trackball uses with the two at x -12.35. The courtyard is what the case opens round for the joystick and the trackball read from above (-14.6..14.6 by -13.1..13.1); User.1 draws the side-read trackball's outline (its module board's and its ball seat's at the case's top, written by ErgoCai.modules trackball/PMW3610-side-pogo build/mount_outline.py for the ball there), for a case of its own (layers [User.1], cut: outline). No 3D model of the module here: the config's assemblies place it as a part of its own"
		(at 0 0 0)
